{"id":"714c179fab3ebb50","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-sigma-equation.md","title":"简单多型的条件等式","display":"df-sigma-equation — 简单多型的条件等式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-sigma-equation","aliases":["16-df-sigma-equation","Typed equation over a signature"],"display":"df-sigma-equation — 简单多型的条件等式","depends_on":["[[16-df-algebraic-signature]]"],"source":"Definition3.2.1 p.178 (PDF198); corrects previous dependent-type conflation","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-sigma-equation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-sigma-equation</span><span>Typed equation over a signature</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigma-equation — 简单多型的条件等式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"afcc53893d447b1b\" href=\"?note=afcc53893d447b1b\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-signature\">16-df-algebraic-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition3.2.1 p.178 (PDF198); corrects previous dependent-type conflation"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"afcc53893d447b1b\" href=\"?note=afcc53893d447b1b\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-signature\">16-df-algebraic-signature</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\sigma,s,t)\">\\(E=(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\sigma,s,t)\\)</span> 为候选记录，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> 是有限列表，其元素 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_i=(\\tau_i,u_i,v_i)\">\\(\\theta_i=(\\tau_i,u_i,v_i)\\)</span>；这里所有型属均为简单排序。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是下文定义的谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\mid\\Theta\\Rightarrow s=_\\sigma t\">\\(\\Gamma\\mid\\Theta\\Rightarrow s=_\\sigma t\\)</span> 是同一记录的排版记号，不是预先给定的推导关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma(E)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp; E=(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\sigma,s,t)\n\\land\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\\land\\sigma\\in S\\land s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Theta\\in\\{(\\tau,u,v)\\mid\\tau\\in S,\\ u,v\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\tau)\\}^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\mathsf{AlgebraicEq}_\\Sigma(E)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma(E)\\land\\Theta=().\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma(E)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp; E=(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\sigma,s,t)\n\\land\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\\land\\sigma\\in S\\land s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Theta\\in\\{(\\tau,u,v)\\mid\\tau\\in S,\\ u,v\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\tau)\\}^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\mathsf{AlgebraicEq}_\\Sigma(E)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma(E)\\land\\Theta=().\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本页按原书 Definition3.2.1 修正为简单多型条件等式，撤去原稿误接的 DTT 签名/依赖项/模型。型正确性现在是双向定义，而非只断言一个未定义的 Eqn 名称。模型有效性另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cbb370bf4db323fd\" href=\"?note=cbb370bf4db323fd\" title=\"16-df-eq-validity\">16-df-eq-validity</a>；零个前提即代数等式。旧的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma;\\vec M=\\vec M&#39;\\Rightarrow N=N&#39;)\">\\((\\Gamma;\\vec M=\\vec M&#39;\\Rightarrow N=N&#39;)\\)</span> 是该五元组的显示变体，不额外引入第二套语法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-algebraic-signature","status":"resolved","id":"afcc53893d447b1b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-algebraic-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-algebraic-signature","status":"resolved","id":"afcc53893d447b1b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$S$、$\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma$ 和 $\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma$ 采用 [[16-df-algebraic-signature]]。$E=(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\sigma,s,t)$ 为候选记录，$\\Theta$ 是有限列表，其元素 $\\theta_i=(\\tau_i,u_i,v_i)$；这里所有型属均为简单排序。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-validity","status":"resolved","id":"cbb370bf4db323fd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本页按原书 Definition3.2.1 修正为简单多型条件等式，撤去原稿误接的 DTT 签名/依赖项/模型。型正确性现在是双向定义，而非只断言一个未定义的 Eqn 名称。模型有效性另见 [[16-df-eq-validity]]；零个前提即代数等式。旧的 $(\\Gamma;\\vec M=\\vec M'\\Rightarrow N=N')$ 是该五元组的显示变体，不额外引入第二套语法。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"E=(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\sigma,s,t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_i=(\\tau_i,u_i,v_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\mid\\Theta\\Rightarrow s=_\\sigma t","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma(E)\\Longleftrightarrow{}& E=(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\sigma,s,t)\n\\land\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\\land\\sigma\\in S\\land s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\\\\n&\\land\\Theta\\in\\{(\\tau,u,v)\\mid\\tau\\in S,\\ u,v\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\tau)\\}^{<\\omega},\\\\\n\\mathsf{AlgebraicEq}_\\Sigma(E)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma(E)\\land\\Theta=().\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"(\\Gamma;\\vec M=\\vec M'\\Rightarrow N=N')","display":false}],"bytes":1727,"backlinks":[{"id":"02dbbf0106916f6e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\mathsf{Tm}$、$\\mathsf{Sub}$、替换、$f(\\vec t)$ 采用 [[16-df-algebraic-signature]]；$\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma$ 采用 [[16-df-sigma-equation]]。$\\Gamma,\\Delta$ 遍历简单排序语境，$H\\subseteq\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma$ 为条件等式记录集合，$\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma$ 按下文构造；所有规则实例限定在 $\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma)\\times\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma$ 中。"},{"id":"cbb370bf4db323fd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{SigModel}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal B,N)$ 采用 [[16-df-algebraic-model]]；$E=(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\sigma,s,t)$ 满足 [[16-df-sigma-equation]] 的 $\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma(E)$。"},{"id":"1559033331811923","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-328","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-sigma-equation|df-sigma-equation — 简单多型的条件等式]]"}],"outgoing":["afcc53893d447b1b","cbb370bf4db323fd"]}